     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">SNIPED hero finish v1. Applied AFTER Evoto round-trip, before final export. Adds subtle film grain (amount 12 / size 25 / freq 50), skin saturation protection (orange -4 to compensate for any Evoto sat boost), background atmospheric softening (clarity -5). Apply only to Heroes, never to Selects or Proofs.</rdf:li>
